WEBVTT

00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:34.870
Hey, hey, I saw you yesterday.
What's going on?

00:01:34.930 --> 00:01:35.700
What?

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:36.900
Don't play dumb.

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:38.870
You went into a coffee shop
with a guy, didn't you?

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:39.930
Really?

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:43.760
Oh, him? He's just a classmate
from middle school.

00:01:43.980 --> 00:01:45.700
I just happened to bump into him.

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:48.710
I don't know...
You two were pretty cozy.

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:50.280
It's true.

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:53.480
Rather, what's going on with you?

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:55.340
I'm talking about Godai.

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:56.620
Well...

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:57.570
Nothing happened?

00:01:57.790 --> 00:01:59.590
Didn't you give up on him?

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:02.060
Don't be rude!

00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:04.090
Then, you're still stuck on him?

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:10.060
Well, it's true nothing's happened, but...

00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:14.400
That doesn't mean it's over...
I haven't actually given up...

00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:32.180
I wonder what Godai is doing...

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:47.560
There...

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:50.240
Tutoring...

00:02:51.250 --> 00:02:56.470
But, why do you have to take
part-time jobs? Isn't this job enough?

00:02:56.880 --> 00:03:00.680
Well, I have my reasons...

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:07.650
I splurged on that trip...

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:20.210
I think I can handle
upper elementary kids...

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:23.190
Shall I talk to the parents?

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:25.610
The kids here must have
brothers and sisters.

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:29.130
That'll help.

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:32.130
What college did you go to?

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:36.500
Parents nowadays only look
at brand-name colleges.

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:39.210
I don't mean kids studying for
entrance exams.

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:42.030
I'd just help with their homework.

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:44.150
So what college did you go to?

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:47.690
Never mind.
Nobody'd want someone like me...

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:49.960
Not much of a college, huh...?

00:03:54.340 --> 00:03:56.580
It should be
somewhere around here...

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:09.990
Here it is!

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:14.990
"Tutor for hire."
Godai?

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:23.690
Okay, stand in line.

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:27.040
Alley oop!

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:37.640
Alley oop!

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:39.510
Just one more time.

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:41.810
Alley oop!

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:42.770
Godai!

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:07.310
Godai!

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:10.050
Yagami! Why are you here?

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:14.250
I went to your apartment and
Mrs. Ichinose told me you were here.

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:16.250
Butting in...

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:20.860
Alley oop!
Who's next?

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:25.750
Okay, stand in line, stand in line.

00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:28.120
Alley oop!

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:34.070
I guess I'm intruding...

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:37.600
I'm sorry for interrupting your work...

00:05:38.010 --> 00:05:39.810
Alley oop!

00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:44.920
I just wanted to see your face...
So I...

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:48.940
I'm sorry!

00:05:51.690 --> 00:05:52.790
Yagami!

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:07.930
You're kind after all.

00:06:08.270 --> 00:06:09.540
I'm just weak-willed.

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:13.040
Godai, are you looking for
part-time tutoring jobs?

00:06:13.550 --> 00:06:14.330
Well...

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:17.270
Shall I introduce you to a good student?

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:23.250
A high school coed who's worried
about college entrance exams.

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:25.250
Did you read my sign carefully?

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:27.420
I'm only accepting up to junior high.

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:28.450
Why?

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:30.920
I attend a third-rate private college.

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:33.750
I can't handle the scholastic ability
of a high school student.

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:39.320
Studying with you would brighten
my gloomy study routine.

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:51.870
Is it impossible?

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:52.760
Impossible!

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:56.420
Well, I'm working, so see you.

00:06:56.860 --> 00:06:58.350
Can I come see you again?

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:00.850
No. I don't think we should meet anymore.

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:05.290
Forget about me and concentrate on
your studies to get into college.

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:17.910
Sorry!

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:19.740
My wallet is...

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:23.750
I'll pay for it.

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:29.640
I'll pay you back next time...

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:33.480
Then I can see you again!

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:49.000
I'm home.

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:50.260
Hi.

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:52.020
Ah...

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:52.830
Yes?

00:07:53.510 --> 00:07:57.940
About this month's rent...
Can you wait a bit for it?

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.810
It's okay. Anytime is fine.

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:02.200
Thank you.

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:04.560
Huh? Are you alone?

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:08.790
I was sure you'd be with that Yagami girl...

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:11.300
Oh, did Yagami come?

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:13.520
She came by the apartment
this afternoon.

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:18.040
When I told her where Godai worked
she ran off.

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:21.430
She just happened to be nearby...

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:23.930
She didn't say that to me.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:31.010
The flame of love that once died
rekindled out of the embers?

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:34.250
That's the scariest kind.

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:36.120
It's nothing like that!

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:38.750
Then why did she come by
out of the blue?

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:39.720
I told you...

00:08:39.920 --> 00:08:40.510
Ah...

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:41.510
Well...

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:42.910
It's...

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:51.200
She's studying for entrance exams and
well, she's psychologically unstable ...

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:56.600
You seem to be unstable in
many areas as well,

00:08:56.670 --> 00:08:59.200
so please take care of
what you need to take care of.

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:00.870
Really.

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:03.640
Sorry...

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:30.480
Only up to junior high school...

00:09:33.350 --> 00:09:35.000
If only I had a younger brother...

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:39.120
Younger brother...

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:40.720
Younger brother?

00:09:41.550 --> 00:09:44.460
Yes! That's doable!

00:09:54.470 --> 00:09:56.700
Hey, you have a younger brother,
don't you?

00:09:56.770 --> 00:09:58.070
Yeah, I do.

00:09:58.400 --> 00:10:00.240
-Can I borrow him?
-What?

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:00.960
Sorry!

00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:03.610
Here!

00:10:03.850 --> 00:10:04.570
Thank you!

00:10:05.720 --> 00:10:08.870
Please, lend me your brother.
One will do.

00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:11.140
I only have one...

00:10:12.050 --> 00:10:14.170
Godai! Telephone!

00:10:18.460 --> 00:10:19.480
Thank you.

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:22.780
Someone who saw the tutoring sign...

00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:23.890
Really?

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:25.750
Yes, it's Godai...

00:10:26.300 --> 00:10:26.960
Yes.

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:30.090
Is that so...

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:34.470
Tomorrow at seven? I'll be waiting.

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:36.920
Manager!

00:10:39.010 --> 00:10:41.410
You're going to tutor?

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:43.980
Yes. She's bringing the
child tomorrow.

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:49.340
Ah... As soon as I get paid,
I'll pay the rent.

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:54.120
Never mind that.
Just don't strain yourself.

00:10:54.790 --> 00:10:58.410
If you concentrate only on your jobs
and can't graduate next year,

00:10:58.760 --> 00:10:59.860
it'll mean trouble.

00:11:02.980 --> 00:11:03.760
I know.

00:11:06.980 --> 00:11:10.000
She sure sounded young for a mother.

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:13.840
And she sounded familiar...

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:17.480
Is that it?

00:11:17.550 --> 00:11:19.850
Thank you. It's good to have friends.

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:21.910
Remember my
strawberry crepe and shake.

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:23.140
I know.

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:29.360
You're pretty pushy.

00:11:31.130 --> 00:11:35.030
I thought you'd forgotten
all about Godai.

00:11:35.470 --> 00:11:40.790
I just had a cooling-off period.
To find out how I truly felt...

00:11:41.210 --> 00:11:43.200
And, did you find out?

00:11:47.990 --> 00:11:51.440
The instant I saw his smile for
the first time in two months...

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:59.750
My tiny chest
almost burst with emotion...

00:12:02.890 --> 00:12:05.460
It really is a tiny chest...

00:12:09.070 --> 00:12:10.520
Mind your own business!

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:16.610
Anyway, I knew then that he
was the only one for me...

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:22.270
This time ...

00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:28.650
I'll attain true love.!

00:12:47.270 --> 00:12:49.290
And the next day...

00:13:02.730 --> 00:13:05.350
Big Brother, can you help me
with my homework?

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:07.760
I'm busy right now.
Can we do it later?

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:12.920
From today, if Godai teaches you,
you'll have to pay.

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:14.000
Really?

00:13:14.780 --> 00:13:17.240
I won't take money from Kentaro!

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:22.690
I wonder if there are people who'd pay
Big Brother to teach them.

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:25.570
That's a good one. Smart kid.

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:30.550
His mother doesn't teach him right...

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:33.780
Manager!

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:36.020
They should be here soon.

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:38.120
She said 7 o'clock.

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:44.260
I'll check out front.

00:13:45.540 --> 00:13:46.900
Th...thank you.

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:51.190
What was the name?

00:13:54.010 --> 00:13:59.000
Forgetting to ask the name...
Can he handle tutoring?

00:14:12.820 --> 00:14:15.220
It's been a while, Manager.

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:17.470
Yagami!

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:21.240
Is Godai in?

00:14:21.510 --> 00:14:23.330
Y-Yagami!

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:24.430
Good evening!

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:26.370
Why are you...?

00:14:26.750 --> 00:14:29.430
I talked to you regarding tutoring...

00:14:29.670 --> 00:14:31.460
But, that was...

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:34.800
It's because you didn't
ask her name!

00:14:39.030 --> 00:14:41.550
He's not your brother, is he?

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:45.250
Rest easy. He's my friend's brother.

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:47.180
In place of the mother.

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:49.790
Why, it's Yagami!

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:50.630
Good evening.

00:14:50.690 --> 00:14:52.990
It's been a while. Come on in.

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:54.670
May I?

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:57.270
Come in...

00:14:59.150 --> 00:15:00.910
I've never seen any place so dirty.

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:02.510
What an honest kid.

00:15:06.020 --> 00:15:10.040
Akemi! Mr. Yotsuya! Are you in?

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:14.440
It looks like you fell into Yagami's trap.

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:15.710
I'm sorry.

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:19.130
I wonder if she's going to
barge in every week.

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:25.550
No! I won't let her!
I won't let Yagami into this apartment!

00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:30.000
What grade are you in?

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:31.190
Fifth.

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:34.830
You have quite an intelligent nose.

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:40.100
Little boy, take my advice.
Find yourself a better tutor.

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:41.470
What do you mean by that?!

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:44.380
Where do you go to college?

00:15:46.890 --> 00:15:48.050
Where?

00:15:52.190 --> 00:15:55.450
It's a college he can't brag about.

00:15:55.540 --> 00:15:58.960
Everyone, you're interrupting.

00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:04.140
Why? He'll find out sooner or later.

00:16:08.100 --> 00:16:09.400
Toru, what do you think?

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:14.600
Well, his scholastic ability is questionable,
but he seems like a nice person.

00:16:14.680 --> 00:16:15.800
Doesn't he?

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:20.670
And, it's not good to expect
too much from a tutor...

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:22.670
I guess he'll do.

00:16:26.060 --> 00:16:27.400
Then, it's decided?

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:28.710
Okay.

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:39.660
Okay, this is the tuition for one month
in advance. We'll see you.

00:16:40.050 --> 00:16:40.930
Wait a minute.

00:16:42.620 --> 00:16:46.240
Before I accept this,
I want to make one thing clear.

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:48.370
Yagami, come here.

00:17:00.270 --> 00:17:03.790
Do I look like a woman who'd use
that child as an excuse?

00:17:03.860 --> 00:17:05.730
C-Calm down, Yagami!

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:17.970
Don't you believe me, sir?

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:21.980
I promise I won't come visiting,
so don't worry!

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:25.780
Okay. I just wanted to make sure.

00:17:26.930 --> 00:17:29.410
One... two... three...

00:17:29.800 --> 00:17:33.250
Tutors make pretty good money.

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:34.880
That's mine!

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:38.940
In celebration of Godai's part-time job!

00:17:39.010 --> 00:17:40.470
Shall we have some fun?

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:41.760
Let's go! Let's go!

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:46.010
I'm not treating! I won't treat you!

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:51.970
We're going to celebrate
your part-time job. Don't be so unfriendly.

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:57.550
Work and work
but our livelihood never gets easier.

00:17:58.150 --> 00:17:58.950
How futile...

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:07.850
You understand, I'm not treating!
You got that?

00:18:08.360 --> 00:18:12.300
Absolutely! Absolutely!
Absolutely not treating!

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:15.060
Oh, it's empty already.

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:18.300
Tonight's drink has been exceptional!

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:21.060
Master, give us another bottle...

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:23.970
I'm really not treating!

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:27.970
A new bottle! A new bottle!

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:37.080
I partake!

00:18:38.890 --> 00:18:40.050
Let's celebrate!

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:41.310
I'm not treating!!

00:18:44.360 --> 00:18:46.650
Damn! Why does it turn out like this?

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:50.090
I'm sorry, I don't have much cash...

00:18:56.450 --> 00:18:59.210
I hope the week goes by quickly...

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:09.180
Good night...Godai.

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:24.430
After paying the rent, I'm broke again...

00:19:29.550 --> 00:19:35.250
He's a cocky kid, but he seems smart.
It might be an easy job...

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:37.980
Well, things will turn out...

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:51.560
Oh, Godai, did you find a tutoring job?

00:19:53.060 --> 00:19:54.150
Yeah...

00:19:54.240 --> 00:19:55.560
That's good.

00:19:56.740 --> 00:20:01.130
I tried the mothers
but there just wasn't anybody.

00:20:01.450 --> 00:20:03.840
Yeah, no matter
how nice a guy you are,

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:07.010
they're all only interested
in the name of your college.

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:11.480
It's unusual nowadays for someone
to choose you just because you're nice.

00:20:11.550 --> 00:20:14.110
Yeah, you have to take care
of such people.

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:22.650
Then, on the first day of tutoring.

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:07.860
I'm home!

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:10.710
Welcome back.
You're finally starting today.

00:21:10.780 --> 00:21:15.070
Yes. See, I bought reference books
for elementary school students.

00:21:15.650 --> 00:21:16.910
Good luck.

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:18.180
Thanks!

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:42.120
He should be here soon...

00:21:47.140 --> 00:21:48.100
Excuse me!

00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:49.210
He's here!

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:53.010
That voice...

00:21:56.890 --> 00:21:58.020
Good evening!

00:21:59.930 --> 00:22:02.720
Yagami! Why are you here?

00:22:03.470 --> 00:22:07.700
After you said you'd tutor from today.

00:22:08.160 --> 00:22:09.720
For that boy...

00:22:10.280 --> 00:22:14.680
What? Toru was representing my mother.

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:21.340
That's subterfuge!

00:22:21.550 --> 00:22:23.740
Didn't he say so then?

00:22:24.790 --> 00:22:26.070
In place of the mother.

00:22:27.260 --> 00:22:28.640
Then, it's decided?

00:22:29.350 --> 00:22:30.310
Okay.

00:22:31.260 --> 00:22:33.870
Then, that kid was...

00:22:34.620 --> 00:22:36.180
I'm the student.

00:22:36.470 --> 00:22:39.860
But, you told me
you wouldn't come visiting...

00:22:40.300 --> 00:22:42.740
That's why I came here
to study like this!

00:22:46.800 --> 00:22:49.500
It seems there was
a misunderstanding.

00:22:50.570 --> 00:22:51.770
It seems that way.

00:22:52.190 --> 00:22:54.710
Damn! You tricked me!

00:22:55.760 --> 00:22:58.610
If you insist on canceling,

00:22:59.150 --> 00:23:01.950
will you please return the tuition
I've paid in advance?

00:23:05.350 --> 00:23:07.580
I'm depending on you!

00:23:11.330 --> 00:23:13.380
Let's go, Godai!

00:23:15.800 --> 00:23:20.770
I'll work real hard.
I won't cause you any trouble.

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:33.340
He was trapped after all.

00:23:34.150 --> 00:23:35.870
Let's go. Hurry!!

00:23:45.950 --> 00:23:48.210
Mom and Dad are out tonight.

00:23:48.630 --> 00:23:50.520
You don't have to get excited, too!

00:23:50.700 --> 00:23:54.050
Young Godai and Yagami
are studying all alone, you know!

00:23:54.130 --> 00:23:58.210
Next: "Godai's on the Edge!
Trapped by a High School Girl!"

00:23:58.340 --> 00:24:01.520
Young Godai, be responsible!
